            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-tc-accent hover:bg-tc-accentHover text-slate-950 font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-xl transition-all shadow-lg text-xs md:text-sm"
          >
            <span>Daftar Magang WordPress via WA</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ ACCORDION SECTION -->
        <section id="faq-section" class="border-t border-tc-border pt-8 space-y-4">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">FAQ Magang WordPress Developer</h3>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <details class="bg-tc-bg p-4 rounded-xl border border-tc-border group cursor-pointer">
              <summary class="text-xs md:text-sm font-semibold text-white flex justify-between items-center list-none select-none">
                <span>Apa tugas magang WordPress?</span>
                <span class="text-tc-accent text-xs group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
              </summary>
              <p class="text-tc-muted text-xs mt-2 border-t border-tc-border/40 pt-2 leading-relaxed">
                Tugas umumnya meliputi memasang dan mengatur tema, memilih plugin, mengelola halaman dan artikel, serta merapikan tampilan website. Detail tugas dikonfirmasi bersama mentor di tempat magang.
              </p>
            </details>

            <details class="bg-tc-bg p-4 rounded-xl border border-tc-border group cursor-pointer">
              <summary class="text-xs md:text-sm font-semibold text-white flex justify-between items-center list-none select-none">
                <span>Apakah magang WordPress perlu bisa coding?</span>
                <span class="text-tc-accent text-xs group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
              </summary>
              <p class="text-tc-muted text-xs mt-2 border-t border-tc-border/40 pt-2 leading-relaxed">
                Tidak wajib untuk pemula. Penggunaan dasar WordPress dapat dipelajari lebih dulu, tetapi HTML dan CSS membantu saat tampilan perlu disesuaikan secara khusus.
              </p>
            </details>

            <details class="bg-tc-bg p-4 rounded-xl border border-tc-border group cursor-pointer">
              <summary class="text-xs md:text-sm font-semibold text-white flex justify-between items-center list-none select-none">
                <span>Apa bedanya magang WordPress dengan magang web developer biasa?</span>
                <span class="text-tc-accent text-xs group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
              </summary>
              <p class="text-tc-muted text-xs mt-2 border-t border-tc-border/40 pt-2 leading-relaxed">
                Magang WordPress berfokus pada platform manajemen konten siap pakai, sedangkan magang web developer biasa lebih banyak menulis kode HTML, CSS, dan JavaScript dari awal.
              </p>
            </details>
          </div>
        </section>

      </article>

      <!-- SIDEBAR (KANAN) -->
      <aside class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-6">
        <div class="sticky top-24 space-y-6">
          
          <!-- Box Fast Contact -->
          <div class="bg-tc-card p-6 rounded-3xl border border-tc-border space-y-4 shadow-xl">
